[
  {
    "id": "fr-pron",
    "title": "代词",
    "items": [
      {
        "id": "fr-pron-1st-2nd",
        "title": "第一二人称代词",
        "inflect": "decl",
        "tables": [
          {
            "caption": "第一人称",
            "role": "pattern",
            "headers": [
              "",
              "单数",
              "复数"
            ],
            "rows": [
              [
                "主语",
                "<bdi>je</bdi>",
                "<bdi>nous</bdi>"
              ],
              [
                "直接宾语",
                "<bdi>me</bdi>",
                "<bdi>nous</bdi>"
              ],
              [
                "间接宾语",
                "<bdi>me</bdi>",
                "<bdi>nous</bdi>"
              ],
              [
                "自反",
                "<bdi>me</bdi>",
                "<bdi>nous</bdi>"
              ],
              [
                "重读",
                "<bdi>moi</bdi>",
                "<bdi>nous</bdi>"
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "caption": "第二人称",
            "role": "pattern",
            "headers": [
              "",
              "单数",
              "复数"
            ],
            "rows": [
              [
                "主语",
                "<bdi>tu</bdi>",
                "<bdi>vous</bdi>"
              ],
              [
                "直接宾语",
                "<bdi>te</bdi>",
                "<bdi>vous</bdi>"
              ],
              [
                "间接宾语",
                "<bdi>te</bdi>",
                "<bdi>vous</bdi>"
              ],
              [
                "自反",
                "<bdi>te</bdi>",
                "<bdi>vous</bdi>"
              ],
              [
                "重读",
                "<bdi>toi</bdi>",
                "<bdi>vous</bdi>"
              ]
            ]
          }
        ],
        "notes": "主语代词不可省略（与意大利语、西班牙语不同）。宾语代词置于动词前（肯定命令式除外：<bdi>Regarde-le !</bdi>），<bdi>me / te</bdi> 在元音或哑音 h 前省音（<bdi>m'aime</bdi>、<bdi>t'appelle</bdi>）。重读形式用于介词后（<bdi>avec moi</bdi>）、强调（<bdi>Moi, je…</bdi>）与省略句（<bdi>Qui ? — Lui</bdi>.）。"
      },
      {
        "id": "fr-pron-3rd",
        "title": "第三人称代词",
        "inflect": "decl",
        "tables": [
          {
            "caption": "第三人称",
            "role": "pattern",
            "headers": [
              "",
              "单数阳性",
              "单数阴性",
              "复数阳性",
              "复数阴性"
            ],
            "rows": [
              [
                "主语",
                "<bdi>il</bdi>",
                "<bdi>elle</bdi>",
                "<bdi>ils</bdi>",
                "<bdi>elles</bdi>"
              ],
              [
                "直接宾语",
                "<bdi>le</bdi>",
                "<bdi>la</bdi>",
                "<bdi>les</bdi>",
                "<bdi>les</bdi>"
              ],
              [
                "间接宾语",
                "<bdi>lui</bdi>",
                "<bdi>lui</bdi>",
                "<bdi>leur</bdi>",
                "<bdi>leur</bdi>"
              ],
              [
                "自反",
                "<bdi>se</bdi>",
                "<bdi>se</bdi>",
                "<bdi>se</bdi>",
                "<bdi>se</bdi>"
              ],
              [
                "重读",
                "<bdi>lui</bdi>",
                "<bdi>elle</bdi>",
                "<bdi>eux</bdi>",
                "<bdi>elles</bdi>"
              ]
            ]
          }
        ],
        "notes": "<bdi>il</bdi> 也可作无人称主语（<bdi>il pleut</bdi>）。直接宾语 <bdi>le / la</bdi> 在元音或哑音 h 前省音（<bdi>l'homme</bdi>）；间接宾语与自反不分性别（<bdi>lui / leur / se</bdi>）。重读形式用于介词后与强调（<bdi>avec elle</bdi>、<bdi>Eux, ils savent.</bdi>）。"
      },
